    "“线的利用率”开关：线按流量分档上色，空闲变暗、跑满绿色、被限流红色，其余标百分比。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Line Utilization colors lines by throughput: idle lines dim, full lines turn green, and throttled lines turn red. Other lines show a percentage."
