    "产能按稳定满速估算，不算启动过程和库存；分流器平均分给各路，某一路堵住会匀给其他路。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Production assumes steady full-speed operation, without startup or inventory effects. Splitters divide flow evenly; if a branch is blocked, its share is redistributed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
