    "从仓库取源矿、蓝铁矿、砂叶，满载产出高容谷地电池 6 个/分钟。将切换到四号谷地并替换当前布局（不会自动保存）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supplies Originium Ore, Ferrium Ore, and Sandleaf from storage to produce 6 HC Valley Batteries per minute at full capacity. Switches to Valley IV and replaces the current layout (does not save automatically)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从仓库取赤铜矿、稳定碳块，满载产出灼铜装备原件 6 个/分钟。将切换到武陵并替换当前布局（不会自动保存）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supplies Cuprium Ore and Stabilized Carbon from storage to produce 6 Pyrrolite Components per minute at full capacity. Switches to Wuling and replaces the current layout (does not save automatically)."
