    "分流器：一进三出，中间菱形；汇流器：三进一出，中间圆点；物流桥：十字立交，竖的从横的上面跨过去；准入口：直通加一道闸门，右下角小图标是只放行的物品。箭头实色表示这个方向接上了线。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Splitters have one input, three outputs, and a central diamond. Convergers have three inputs, one output, and a central dot. Bridges carry vertical lines over horizontal lines. Control ports are straight-through gates; the lower-right icon shows the allowed item. Solid arrows indicate connected directions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
