    },
    "武陵水泵区：基地右侧单独一条 3 格宽的区域，水泵、二型耐酸水泵、气体收集泵只能放这里，出口朝向基地；这里的泵默认通电，不用放供电桩，区域里不能走线。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wuling pump zone: a separate 3-cell-wide strip to the right of the base. Fluid Pumps, Acid Resistant Pumps Mk II, and Gas Extractors can only be placed here, with outputs facing the base. Pumps here are powered by default and need no Electric Pylon. Lines cannot enter the zone."
